WEBVTT

01:35.890 --> 01:40.830
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.560 --> 01:44.020
[Episode 25]

01:44.120 --> 01:46.229
You don't understand
my painstaking efforts,

01:46.229 --> 01:48.789
nor the righteousness I uphold
for both family and country!

01:48.789 --> 01:49.850
Do you understand?

01:50.560 --> 01:51.759
The so-called family and country—

01:51.759 --> 01:53.229
family comes before country!

01:53.229 --> 01:54.640
You don't even care for your family—

01:54.640 --> 01:57.370
what right do you have
to speak of righteousness?

02:02.710 --> 02:03.640
What did you say?

02:04.710 --> 02:05.680
Only a ruler

02:06.510 --> 02:08.000
who governs with grace and composure

02:08.000 --> 02:09.600
can be called a wise emperor.

02:10.000 --> 02:11.240
To be a good monarch,

02:12.080 --> 02:13.810
one must first be a good person.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.520
Kill her.

02:16.310 --> 02:18.370
This woman cannot be allowed to live.

02:18.370 --> 02:19.560
She said the exact same thing

02:19.560 --> 02:20.829
as your mother did.

02:21.030 --> 02:22.750
Shut this wretch up!

02:26.240 --> 02:29.190
Say one more insulting word to her
and you'll see.

02:30.470 --> 02:31.240
Suige,

02:32.079 --> 02:33.840
I thought after your mother's death,

02:33.840 --> 02:35.970
you would finally come to your senses.

02:36.560 --> 02:37.750
But now there's another woman

02:37.750 --> 02:39.710
like her by your side.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.310
Suige,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.150
for Susha's sake,

02:43.590 --> 02:45.030
I'm begging you—

02:45.190 --> 02:47.400
this woman cannot stay alive.

02:47.910 --> 02:49.910
Kill her!

02:51.560 --> 02:52.150
Listen!

02:52.870 --> 02:53.490
You've already ruined

02:53.490 --> 02:54.870
the first half of Feng Suige's life.

02:54.870 --> 02:56.240
I, Fu Yixiao, will never let you

02:56.240 --> 02:57.430
ruin the rest of it!

02:59.630 --> 03:01.470
Kill her!

03:05.470 --> 03:07.120
Kill her!

03:27.560 --> 03:28.120
Suige.

03:29.000 --> 03:29.560
Suige.

03:31.800 --> 03:32.910
Suige!

03:42.190 --> 03:43.910
Wei Qingyu.

03:46.910 --> 03:48.560
Wei Qingyu...

04:05.400 --> 04:06.080
I'm sorry.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.330
I lost control just now.

04:24.270 --> 04:25.530
Don't take what he said

04:26.260 --> 04:27.630
to heart.

04:28.310 --> 04:30.110
Please don't be angry, alright?

04:35.560 --> 04:37.960
I should thank you
for what you did just now.

04:38.159 --> 04:39.890
You stood up for me inside there

04:40.159 --> 04:42.620
and considered things from my perspective.

04:43.480 --> 04:45.360
But what you said really does sound

04:45.360 --> 04:47.620
just like something my mother would say.

04:47.800 --> 04:48.400
I think...

04:48.930 --> 04:49.960
any decent person

04:50.270 --> 04:51.670
would say the same thing.

04:55.750 --> 04:56.270
What?

04:56.630 --> 04:57.480
Don't tell me

04:57.480 --> 04:58.940
you want to call me Mother.

04:59.630 --> 05:00.480
I wouldn't mind

05:00.480 --> 05:02.280
being someone like your mother.

05:08.390 --> 05:09.070
Alright.

05:09.830 --> 05:10.680
Stop crying.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.660
I'm not crying.

05:14.510 --> 05:16.440
It was just the sandstorm earlier.

05:16.800 --> 05:19.040
How could there be a sandstorm
inside the room?

05:19.040 --> 05:19.770
I don't care.

05:20.270 --> 05:21.930
There was a lot of sand anyway.

05:27.720 --> 05:28.510
Don't worry.

05:29.160 --> 05:29.890
With me here,

05:30.160 --> 05:31.430
no sandstorm will ever

05:31.430 --> 05:32.360
reach you again.

05:46.390 --> 05:47.120
Ma Qiming,

05:48.000 --> 05:49.730
you know all of this, don't you?

05:51.040 --> 05:53.370
How dare you ask me
to come here to save him?

06:11.720 --> 06:12.850
You're leaving too?

06:15.560 --> 06:16.750
I never imagined

06:17.560 --> 06:20.160
you would treat Suige like this
all these years.

06:20.160 --> 06:20.920
And I never thought

06:20.920 --> 06:23.050
Qingyu would die right in front of you!

06:23.510 --> 06:24.440
Feng Pingcheng,

06:24.750 --> 06:26.750
from now on, we're completely done—

06:26.800 --> 06:28.130
whether living or dead.

06:30.430 --> 06:31.630
Before I leave, I'll tell you

06:31.630 --> 06:32.630
one last thing.

06:33.480 --> 06:34.630
All these years, the reason

06:34.630 --> 06:36.159
I went all out to save you

06:37.390 --> 06:38.920
was that Qingyu asked me to.

06:39.800 --> 06:40.870
You've been trying so hard

06:40.870 --> 06:42.000
to defeat Qingyu,

06:43.510 --> 06:44.430
yet he was the one

06:44.430 --> 06:46.090
who actually saved your life.

06:47.870 --> 06:48.480
Move.

07:21.160 --> 07:22.450
It's been the whole day.

07:22.450 --> 07:23.600
How could so many people

07:23.600 --> 07:24.630
still not have found His Majesty?

07:24.630 --> 07:25.430
Your Majesty,

07:25.430 --> 07:27.030
the Imperial Guards said so.

07:27.120 --> 07:28.270
They've searched the entire Yujing City

07:28.270 --> 07:29.920
and found no trace of His Majesty.

07:29.920 --> 07:30.760
No one knows

07:30.920 --> 07:31.800
where he went.

07:32.240 --> 07:33.500
Prepare the carriage.

07:33.510 --> 07:35.310
I'll go find His Majesty myself.

07:35.390 --> 07:36.560
-So many people are looking for him.
-Yes.

07:36.560 --> 07:38.159
You won't make a difference.

07:39.240 --> 07:40.000
Leave us.

07:48.310 --> 07:49.000
Father.

07:49.480 --> 07:50.920
Where has His Majesty gone?

07:50.920 --> 07:52.040
No need to ask so many questions.

07:52.040 --> 07:52.970
Pack your things

07:53.310 --> 07:55.800
and take Chengyang out of the palace
for safety.

07:55.800 --> 07:56.870
What happened?

07:57.890 --> 07:59.690
His Majesty is not in the palace.

07:59.870 --> 08:01.040
It's not safe here.

08:01.970 --> 08:02.810
Father,

08:03.160 --> 08:04.890
how could the palace be unsafe?

08:05.160 --> 08:06.000
Is Feng Suige

08:06.000 --> 08:07.130
acting crazy again?

08:07.560 --> 08:08.830
He has no right to run wild

08:08.830 --> 08:10.360
in the land of Sushan yet.

08:10.920 --> 08:12.720
Go tell Chengyang to pack up.

08:12.750 --> 08:14.150
You're leaving tonight.

08:15.480 --> 08:17.480
What exactly happened to His Majesty?

08:17.480 --> 08:18.070
Father,

08:18.600 --> 08:20.120
what are you afraid of?

08:23.950 --> 08:25.410
As long as you know nothing

08:25.750 --> 08:26.950
about what I'm doing,

08:28.360 --> 08:30.040
you won't be implicated.

08:30.720 --> 08:31.630
At this point,

08:32.630 --> 08:34.490
what are you still hiding from me?

08:34.750 --> 08:35.600
You don't even

08:36.270 --> 08:37.390
listen to me.

08:37.840 --> 08:39.570
Why won't you tell me the truth?

08:40.440 --> 08:42.080
What exactly are you planning to do?

08:42.080 --> 08:43.659
Why do you refuse to tell me?

08:43.960 --> 08:45.020
All these years,

08:45.270 --> 08:46.960
Feng Pingcheng has also been
keeping secrets from me,

08:46.960 --> 08:47.480
never telling me

08:47.480 --> 08:48.550
about his illness.

08:49.320 --> 08:49.670
Father,

08:49.670 --> 08:51.200
what are you planning to do?

08:51.480 --> 08:52.600
Tell me.

08:56.440 --> 08:57.480
I've had enough!

08:58.000 --> 08:59.670
Am I not a member of the Zhuang family?

08:59.670 --> 09:00.830
Am I not the Empress?

09:00.910 --> 09:02.510
Am I not Chengyang's mother?

09:02.720 --> 09:03.720
Why has all the truth

09:03.720 --> 09:05.080
been kept from me?

09:06.600 --> 09:07.200
Fine.

09:08.750 --> 09:09.440
I'm

09:10.960 --> 09:12.620
going to avenge your brother.

09:13.670 --> 09:14.550
My brother?

09:16.510 --> 09:17.390
Avenge?

09:20.080 --> 09:21.510
Your brother was killed

09:21.510 --> 09:22.570
by Feng Pingcheng.

09:27.750 --> 09:29.670
What nonsense are you talking about?

09:29.670 --> 09:31.370
He was executed for treason.

09:31.480 --> 09:32.550
Treason?

09:33.120 --> 09:34.980
Feng Pingcheng caused his death!

09:35.790 --> 09:36.520
Impossible.

09:37.740 --> 09:39.520
He committed treason.

09:39.870 --> 09:41.440
His entire clan should have been executed,

09:41.440 --> 09:42.910
but Feng Pingcheng showed mercy

09:42.910 --> 09:44.120
and spared the Zhuang family.

09:44.120 --> 09:45.440
Feng Pingcheng has long wanted

09:45.440 --> 09:46.840
to eliminate our family.

09:48.840 --> 09:51.130
He fears our influence

09:51.440 --> 09:53.630
and resents us
for the late empress's death.

09:53.630 --> 09:55.360
He's been holding hatred toward us.

09:55.360 --> 09:58.090
He's wanted to destroy our family
for a long time.

09:59.180 --> 10:00.480
If it weren't for your brother

10:00.480 --> 10:02.220
taking all the blame,

10:02.440 --> 10:04.970
our family would have been wiped out
long ago.

10:05.360 --> 10:06.200
Impossible.

10:06.870 --> 10:08.270
Absolutely impossible.

10:08.270 --> 10:09.470
I wouldn't lie to you.

10:10.480 --> 10:12.790
I kept the truth from you

10:13.750 --> 10:14.840
to protect you

10:14.840 --> 10:15.700
and Chengyang.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.710
Now that you're asking,

10:18.030 --> 10:19.630
I'm telling you everything.

10:20.440 --> 10:21.500
I don't believe it.

10:23.960 --> 10:25.870
Are you saying that all these years

10:25.870 --> 10:27.730
I've been sleeping with our enemy

10:27.960 --> 10:28.910
and serving the man

10:28.910 --> 10:30.380
who killed my brother?

10:31.030 --> 10:32.630
You two are my only children.

10:35.060 --> 10:37.260
I couldn't save your brother back then.

10:37.480 --> 10:39.870
I must keep you safe at all costs.

10:41.510 --> 10:42.510
Listen to me,

10:43.150 --> 10:45.210
take Chengyang out of the palace now.

10:45.510 --> 10:46.910
I don't believe it.

10:47.440 --> 10:48.970
I'm going to ask him myself.

10:49.840 --> 10:50.480
Father,

10:51.240 --> 10:52.600
I can't leave.

10:53.080 --> 10:55.550
I'm the Empress. Where could I go?

10:58.160 --> 11:00.120
I will avenge your brother myself.

11:01.630 --> 11:03.290
You don't need to hate anyone.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.620
Since you don't want to leave,

11:06.510 --> 11:07.770
then stay in the palace

11:08.240 --> 11:09.350
with Chengyang,

11:10.270 --> 11:11.360
asking nothing

11:12.260 --> 11:13.990
and interfering with nothing.

11:14.120 --> 11:15.660
Once I kill Feng Suige,

11:16.600 --> 11:18.240
Jingheng will be avenged.

11:19.320 --> 11:20.030
Chengyang

11:20.720 --> 11:22.850
will eventually ascend to the throne.

11:23.510 --> 11:24.510
The Zhuang family

11:25.440 --> 11:27.200
will be the ultimate victor.

11:52.320 --> 11:53.120
Grandfather.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.400
Take care of your mother.

12:11.810 --> 12:14.170
[Yifeng Palace]

12:36.030 --> 12:36.840
Xia Jingshi!

12:38.200 --> 12:39.430
If you're a real man,

12:40.000 --> 12:41.300
get out here now!

13:06.670 --> 13:07.320
Yixiao?

13:37.750 --> 13:39.360
Yixiao, it really is you.

13:41.630 --> 13:42.560
Why are you back?

13:55.120 --> 13:55.850
Why is it you?

14:02.270 --> 14:03.080
For you,

14:04.670 --> 14:06.200
I'm willing to do anything,

14:07.840 --> 14:08.750
even pretend to be...

14:08.750 --> 14:10.750
Princess, there's no need for this.

14:11.390 --> 14:13.300
♪ Flying alone ♪

14:13.580 --> 14:16.990
♪ With no need for direction ♪

14:13.600 --> 14:14.800
I lied earlier today.

14:15.960 --> 14:16.550
In the Library,

14:16.550 --> 14:17.870
I did meet the Emperor.

14:18.910 --> 14:19.600
It doesn't matter.

14:19.030 --> 14:21.020
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

14:20.630 --> 14:21.200
The Emperor said

14:21.200 --> 14:22.840
he was glad we met in the Library.

14:21.580 --> 14:23.970
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

14:23.320 --> 14:24.790
But I said I didn't see him.

14:25.870 --> 14:27.000
You don't care about that either?

14:26.610 --> 14:28.450
♪ Roaming freely ♪

14:28.440 --> 14:29.570
Princess, you must have had your reasons

14:28.710 --> 14:31.810
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

14:29.630 --> 14:30.690
for not telling me.

14:34.110 --> 14:35.880
♪ The wet wings ♪

14:34.250 --> 14:36.160
You don't care about anything
concerning me.

14:36.160 --> 14:39.330
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

14:36.440 --> 14:37.440
Xia Jingshi,

14:38.390 --> 14:40.850
do you remember
that we are husband and wife?

14:41.510 --> 14:42.790
I told you before

14:43.360 --> 14:47.020
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

14:44.120 --> 14:46.120
that I can't give you the kind of love

14:46.270 --> 14:47.270
you want.

14:49.490 --> 14:53.780
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

14:49.600 --> 14:51.200
After everything we've been through,

14:51.200 --> 14:52.860
you still hold this attitude?

14:53.910 --> 14:54.790
Xia Jingshi,

14:55.600 --> 14:56.800
if it weren't for you,

14:56.840 --> 14:57.960
how would I have left my home
and my country,

14:57.960 --> 14:58.980
come all the way to Jinxiu,

14:58.410 --> 15:02.010
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

14:59.120 --> 15:00.120
and endured all this humiliation,

15:00.120 --> 15:01.600
living in a place like Rongyang Palace?

15:01.600 --> 15:02.720
If it weren't for you,

15:02.720 --> 15:04.140
I wouldn't have risked
going to the Library

15:04.140 --> 15:05.710
and being humiliated by the Emperor!

15:04.490 --> 15:09.440
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

15:07.030 --> 15:08.030
Princess, do you regret it now?

15:08.030 --> 15:08.910
Yes!

15:10.510 --> 15:12.320
I regret being foolishly in love.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.920
I thought I could change you,

15:14.320 --> 15:15.480
that sincerity

15:15.480 --> 15:16.360
could even melt stone,

15:16.360 --> 15:17.080
that if I tried hard enough,

15:17.080 --> 15:18.440
I could warm your heart.

15:19.270 --> 15:20.150
But I was wrong.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.200
We've been married for so long,

15:23.200 --> 15:24.670
and the only gentle words
I've ever heard from you

15:24.670 --> 15:26.510
were when you mistook me for Fu Yixiao!

15:26.510 --> 15:28.480
In your heart, there's only Fu Yixiao!

15:28.480 --> 15:29.000
Except for Fu Yixiao,

15:29.000 --> 15:30.860
anyone can be sacrificed, right?

15:31.120 --> 15:32.720
What's so special about her?

15:32.870 --> 15:34.670
She has feelings for my brother,

15:34.960 --> 15:36.600
yet still entangles herself with you.

15:36.600 --> 15:37.630
She's been playing you

15:37.630 --> 15:39.280
like a puppet all along!

15:49.240 --> 15:49.910
Princess,

15:51.510 --> 15:53.240
I know you resent me.

15:53.360 --> 15:54.120
You can

15:54.150 --> 15:55.580
vent all your anger on me,

15:55.630 --> 15:56.940
and I won't talk back.

15:58.120 --> 16:00.250
But this has nothing to do with Yixiao.

16:01.030 --> 16:02.360
You have no right to speak about her.

16:02.360 --> 16:03.280
Then I will!

16:04.550 --> 16:05.670
She's a bitch

16:05.670 --> 16:07.530
who's been playing you all along!

16:15.410 --> 16:19.350
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:21.500 --> 16:26.760
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

16:30.220 --> 16:34.580
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:36.300 --> 16:41.250
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

16:43.840 --> 16:45.080
How dare you slap me?

16:45.290 --> 16:49.970
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:46.670 --> 16:47.600
I told you

16:48.150 --> 16:49.410
not to speak about her.

16:50.550 --> 16:51.910
And you don't have the right to.

16:51.530 --> 16:56.740
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

16:54.270 --> 16:55.320
Xia Jingshi,

16:56.840 --> 16:58.150
you'll regret this.

16:58.800 --> 17:06.280
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

17:02.240 --> 17:03.550
I, Feng Xiyang,

17:04.440 --> 17:06.400
will never forget this slap!

17:23.000 --> 17:28.990
[Wutong Mansion]

17:33.640 --> 17:35.440
I know your heart is full of rage,

17:35.920 --> 17:36.480
that you can't wait

17:36.480 --> 17:37.720
to kill Zhuang Shen.

17:38.960 --> 17:40.680
But it's exactly at times like this

17:40.680 --> 17:42.140
that you need to stay calm.

17:42.720 --> 17:44.720
Even if it may make you think I'm nagging,

17:44.720 --> 17:46.270
I have to remind you—

17:47.550 --> 17:49.200
don't underestimate your enemy,

17:49.200 --> 17:50.260
and don't get hurt.

17:58.110 --> 17:59.830
Before, when I went to every battle,

17:59.830 --> 18:00.640
people only cared

18:00.640 --> 18:01.770
whether I could win.

18:03.400 --> 18:04.160
Now, finally,

18:04.160 --> 18:06.560
there's someone
who cares if I'll get hurt.

18:06.990 --> 18:09.120
How could I possibly find you nagging?

18:09.830 --> 18:11.120
In others' eyes,

18:11.270 --> 18:12.670
you are the invincible,

18:12.790 --> 18:14.720
cold-blooded Killer God of Susha.

18:15.160 --> 18:16.230
But in my eyes,

18:17.400 --> 18:18.730
you're just Feng Suige.

18:22.590 --> 18:25.200
When you go back today,
don't think about anything.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.400
Just get a good sleep.

18:32.150 --> 18:33.010
Your Highness.

18:35.750 --> 18:38.280
Whatever it is,
we'll talk about it tomorrow.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.040
Listen to her.

18:40.480 --> 18:42.140
We'll talk about it tomorrow.

18:42.350 --> 18:42.920
Alright.

18:43.250 --> 18:44.550
There's no news from the Hound.

18:44.550 --> 18:45.110
I'll tell you tomorrow.

18:45.110 --> 18:47.040
You are not playing dumb this time?

18:47.720 --> 18:48.640
Quite smart.

18:52.030 --> 18:52.890
Your Highness?

18:53.750 --> 18:54.960
Where did he go?

18:56.000 --> 18:56.860
Your Highness?

18:57.590 --> 18:58.250
Where is he?

18:59.720 --> 19:00.580
Your Highness?

19:00.960 --> 19:02.270
You promised me that when you go back,

19:02.270 --> 19:03.880
you won't think about anything

19:03.880 --> 19:05.480
and will get some real sleep.

19:06.510 --> 19:07.040
Alright.

19:08.480 --> 19:09.480
I'll do as you say.

19:16.920 --> 19:17.400
Yao!

19:17.680 --> 19:18.160
Father!

19:19.440 --> 19:19.900
Father!

19:19.960 --> 19:20.350
Yao,

19:21.070 --> 19:22.000
did you get hurt?

19:22.480 --> 19:24.140
I'm fine. Just untie me first.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.030
Father.

19:37.070 --> 19:37.960
Kill them all!

19:38.680 --> 19:39.610
Don't kill them!

19:41.270 --> 19:42.160
It's not...

19:46.480 --> 19:47.310
Their fault.

20:04.310 --> 20:04.830
Father.

20:05.750 --> 20:06.750
Let's go, Father.

20:10.960 --> 20:12.270
All of you, get out!

20:39.060 --> 20:40.700
I still can't believe

20:42.480 --> 20:43.680
that my son

20:44.960 --> 20:45.640
is actually

20:45.640 --> 20:48.000
a villain who kills innocent people.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.240
Yao,

20:53.030 --> 20:54.350
you never lie to me.

20:55.480 --> 20:57.000
Be honest with me—

20:58.270 --> 20:59.030
can I still

20:59.030 --> 21:00.440
trust you?

21:04.680 --> 21:05.440
Tell me,

21:06.310 --> 21:08.150
was what that female general

21:08.400 --> 21:10.200
of Jinxiu said true?

21:12.350 --> 21:13.200
Tell me!

21:14.880 --> 21:15.940
Whatever I've done

21:17.510 --> 21:18.440
has nothing to do

21:18.550 --> 21:20.960
with you or the Murong family.

21:21.750 --> 21:23.680
I'll bear the consequences alone.

21:31.720 --> 21:32.560
So...

21:33.160 --> 21:34.020
everything...

21:34.030 --> 21:35.690
everything she said was true?

21:36.000 --> 21:37.000
They are all true?

21:39.790 --> 21:41.790
You wouldn't dare rebel on your own.

21:41.920 --> 21:43.650
Tell me who your accomplice is.

21:44.030 --> 21:45.830
Is it that old fox Zhuang Shen?

21:49.110 --> 21:49.640
Yes.

21:51.880 --> 21:52.680
He promised me

21:53.640 --> 21:55.750
that once Feng Chengyang
ascends to the throne,

21:55.750 --> 21:56.750
the Murong family

21:57.000 --> 21:59.800
will be granted the title
of a royal house of Susha.

22:00.880 --> 22:02.140
You're being foolish.

22:02.590 --> 22:03.070
Father,

22:03.480 --> 22:05.000
I'm perfectly clear-headed.

22:05.000 --> 22:06.660
I know exactly what I'm doing.

22:08.160 --> 22:09.620
Feng Suige told me long ago

22:10.110 --> 22:11.960
that he would never take the throne.

22:11.960 --> 22:13.200
He's a man of his word

22:13.240 --> 22:14.100
who never lies.

22:14.830 --> 22:16.350
But if he doesn't become the emperor,

22:16.350 --> 22:18.150
how can we become a royal family?

22:18.310 --> 22:20.350
I had no choice
but to ally with the Zhuang family—

22:20.350 --> 22:21.310
to join forces with that old fox,

22:21.310 --> 22:22.200
Zhuang Shen—

22:22.640 --> 22:24.240
to fulfill my lifelong wish.

22:24.960 --> 22:26.330
Even His Majesty knows

22:26.400 --> 22:28.400
one must never raise a tiger
that could later turn on him.

22:28.400 --> 22:29.480
Do you think Zhuang Shen

22:29.480 --> 22:30.590
would let his grandson-in-law

22:30.590 --> 22:32.240
have a powerful rival outside?

22:32.240 --> 22:33.030
Once he's done using you,

22:33.030 --> 22:34.310
he'll get rid of you!

22:34.350 --> 22:35.070
How could you believe

22:35.070 --> 22:36.680
that old bastard's nonsense?

22:36.680 --> 22:38.370
I have proof of his treason!

22:38.920 --> 22:39.830
If he dares go back on his word,

22:39.830 --> 22:41.800
I'll drag him down with me!

22:42.270 --> 22:43.270
He wouldn't dare.

22:43.960 --> 22:44.440
Father,

22:46.160 --> 22:46.790
by then,

22:48.110 --> 22:48.920
our whole family will be able to

22:48.920 --> 22:49.780
move to Xijing.

22:50.680 --> 22:51.530
Shut up.

22:51.790 --> 22:53.030
This is what the Murong family

22:53.030 --> 22:54.000
rightfully deserves!

22:54.000 --> 22:54.720
Shut up!

22:55.160 --> 22:56.610
After being granted the title,

22:56.610 --> 22:57.640
you'll never have to garrison

22:57.640 --> 22:59.200
the freezing borderlands again.

22:59.200 --> 22:59.890
You can spend

22:59.890 --> 23:00.680
-your remaining years in comfort.
-Shut up!

23:00.680 --> 23:01.160
Father.

23:01.240 --> 23:02.240
Shut up!

23:06.440 --> 23:06.960
Father.

23:08.270 --> 23:08.730
Father.

23:09.200 --> 23:09.860
Your leg...

23:10.110 --> 23:10.570
Father!

23:11.440 --> 23:11.900
Father,

23:12.200 --> 23:12.880
your leg...

23:17.550 --> 23:18.070
Father,

23:18.920 --> 23:19.960
if I don't do this,

23:19.960 --> 23:22.110
you'll sooner or later
die worn out at the frontier.

23:22.110 --> 23:23.070
If Feng Pingcheng had even

23:23.070 --> 23:23.880
a shred of decency toward you,

23:23.880 --> 23:25.610
he wouldn't treat you this way.

23:25.750 --> 23:27.350
Am I wrong to want to kill him?

23:32.790 --> 23:33.790
If he doesn't die,

23:34.680 --> 23:35.880
you will, Father.

23:37.000 --> 23:39.060
You've worked hard your entire life.

23:39.160 --> 23:39.720
Don't you deserve

23:39.720 --> 23:40.920
a few days of peace?

23:42.200 --> 23:43.200
I'm not doing this

23:43.440 --> 23:44.830
for myself;

23:45.400 --> 23:47.270
I'm doing it for the Murong family.

23:47.270 --> 23:48.350
I can't accept it!

23:48.550 --> 23:49.720
Why should the Murong family

23:49.720 --> 23:52.050
be trampled under the Feng family's feet?

23:53.680 --> 23:55.480
How many times have I told you?

23:57.480 --> 23:59.350
This is our fate.

23:59.790 --> 24:00.850
I don't believe it.

24:01.640 --> 24:02.200
Father,

24:03.000 --> 24:04.330
I don't believe in fate!

24:11.200 --> 24:13.130
I've fought in battles all my life.

24:14.240 --> 24:15.350
I fear nothing—

24:15.960 --> 24:16.820
not even death.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.330
The only thing I fear

24:19.960 --> 24:21.830
is something happening to you.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.070
When

24:25.030 --> 24:26.830
I'm wronged or mistreated,

24:28.310 --> 24:30.350
I never dare to argue or complain,

24:31.960 --> 24:33.160
always holding back.

24:35.790 --> 24:38.240
As long as you can live healthy and safe,

24:39.750 --> 24:41.110
I'm content.

24:43.200 --> 24:43.800
Father...

24:44.070 --> 24:44.790
Yao,

24:46.510 --> 24:48.640
there's something you must remember:

24:50.960 --> 24:52.550
everyone makes mistakes.

24:53.510 --> 24:56.030
But when you're wrong, you must admit it

24:57.590 --> 24:59.110
and make it right.

25:05.640 --> 25:07.680
But as long as I'm still alive,

25:08.960 --> 25:09.760
you don't need

25:10.550 --> 25:12.240
to shoulder any burdens.

25:14.720 --> 25:15.780
As long as I'm here,

25:17.510 --> 25:19.710
you don't need to be afraid of anything.

25:45.510 --> 25:46.830
All of you, come in!

25:52.510 --> 25:53.640
I know you

25:55.240 --> 25:57.200
are loyal to the Young Master.

25:58.350 --> 25:59.030
But

26:00.000 --> 26:02.000
it's precisely this loyalty

26:02.110 --> 26:05.030
that has led him to this deadly situation!

26:10.680 --> 26:13.160
I'll put aside each of your crimes

26:14.510 --> 26:15.880
for now.

26:17.720 --> 26:19.630
If you don't want him to die,

26:19.750 --> 26:21.790
carry him back
to the Marquis's Mansion now

26:21.790 --> 26:23.240
and keep a close watch on him.

26:23.240 --> 26:23.970
Understand?

26:24.720 --> 26:25.960
Yes, My Lord.

26:29.440 --> 26:31.270
Go find me some thorny branches.

26:33.350 --> 26:36.480
Tomorrow I'll enter the palace
to see His Majesty

26:38.160 --> 26:39.490
and ask him to punish me.

26:55.000 --> 26:55.790
Your Majesty.

26:55.790 --> 26:57.320
Your Majesty, are you back?

27:01.400 --> 27:02.200
Your Majesty.

27:02.960 --> 27:04.420
Your Majesty, how are you?

27:05.790 --> 27:06.480
Your Majesty,

27:06.480 --> 27:07.480
please say something.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.740
I'm worried about you.

27:11.070 --> 27:11.870
Your Majesty,

27:12.960 --> 27:14.830
I want to talk to you about something.

27:14.830 --> 27:15.680
Could we speak in...

27:15.680 --> 27:17.210
There's nothing left to say

27:17.680 --> 27:19.350
between us.

27:25.550 --> 27:26.550
My father told me

27:26.550 --> 27:27.790
the cause of my brother's death.

27:27.790 --> 27:28.920
Is what he said true?

27:28.920 --> 27:29.480
Yes.

27:30.830 --> 27:31.590
You didn't even ask me

27:31.590 --> 27:32.860
what my father told me.

27:33.000 --> 27:34.310
I don't care.

27:34.680 --> 27:35.480
Your Majesty,

27:35.830 --> 27:36.960
His Majesty is tired.

27:36.960 --> 27:39.360
-He needs to go back to rest.
-Your Majesty!

27:39.510 --> 27:40.240
If you still care about the bond

27:40.240 --> 27:41.790
between us as husband and wife,

27:41.790 --> 27:43.190
please tell me the truth!

27:47.240 --> 27:48.550
Prepare to depart!

27:48.720 --> 27:49.520
Your Majesty!

28:49.240 --> 28:51.310
Zhuang has returned to his residence.

28:51.310 --> 28:52.960
Go keep an eye on him.

29:00.400 --> 29:00.930
Let's go.

29:10.840 --> 29:13.710
[Zhuang Residence]

30:14.240 --> 30:15.570
What are you doing here?

30:16.230 --> 30:18.090
Didn't I tell you to get some rest?

30:18.640 --> 30:19.640
I couldn't sleep.

30:20.750 --> 30:22.920
Then why didn't you call me
when you got here?

30:22.920 --> 30:24.520
I didn't want to disturb you.

30:26.640 --> 30:27.500
What about you?

30:28.030 --> 30:29.510
Why are you still up at this hour?

30:29.510 --> 30:30.640
Where are you going?

30:31.310 --> 30:33.350
I was worried that you couldn't sleep,

30:33.350 --> 30:34.810
so I wanted to check on you.

30:44.830 --> 30:47.560
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

30:47.980 --> 30:50.550
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

30:51.130 --> 30:53.850
♪ Even if the wilderness is boundless ♪

30:54.780 --> 30:56.920
♪ We won't separate ♪

30:57.420 --> 31:00.750
♪ In the dark night, I look back ♪

31:01.220 --> 31:04.110
♪ Amid despair ♪

31:04.720 --> 31:07.180
♪ A stick of incense, a drop of tear,
an inch of ash ♪

31:07.820 --> 31:10.650
♪ Gathered and parted, all for you ♪

31:13.990 --> 31:16.230
♪ You and I silently recite ♪

31:27.000 --> 31:28.860
Since you were already prepared,

31:28.880 --> 31:29.510
why didn't you send people

31:29.510 --> 31:30.840
to kill Feng Pingcheng?

31:31.110 --> 31:32.430
Once Feng Pingcheng dies,

31:32.430 --> 31:32.830
with you

31:32.830 --> 31:33.830
and Her Majesty here,

31:33.830 --> 31:34.830
the Zhuang family can still...

31:34.830 --> 31:36.090
What I want is revenge.

31:37.400 --> 31:38.660
Don't you understand?

31:41.640 --> 31:42.840
I understand, Uncle.

31:43.000 --> 31:43.920
No, you don't.

31:44.510 --> 31:45.960
You have no vengeance in your heart—

31:45.960 --> 31:47.440
only a desire for power.

31:47.960 --> 31:49.750
Jingheng was my only son

31:50.680 --> 31:51.750
and my only hope.

31:52.750 --> 31:53.790
I've stayed alive

31:54.510 --> 31:55.790
not for power

31:56.550 --> 31:57.920
but to avenge him.

32:06.790 --> 32:08.440
Can I trust you?

32:13.400 --> 32:13.920
Yes.

32:14.720 --> 32:16.670
I will kill Feng Suige

32:16.830 --> 32:17.750
and make Feng Pingcheng

32:17.750 --> 32:19.480
suffer the pain of losing a son.

32:19.590 --> 32:21.520
I will personally cut off his head.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.330
Yes.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.570
Complete this task,

32:23.590 --> 32:26.320
and you'll be the Zhuang family's
greatest hero.

32:26.640 --> 32:27.830
The Zhuang family will be yours

32:27.830 --> 32:28.640
in the future.

32:28.880 --> 32:30.960
After Chengyang ascends to the throne,

32:30.960 --> 32:33.000
you will be the head of the Zhuang family

32:33.000 --> 32:33.720
and

32:34.680 --> 32:36.740
the most powerful minister in Susha.

32:40.510 --> 32:41.640
Don't worry, Uncle.

32:42.200 --> 32:44.830
I would rather die than fail this mission.

32:48.240 --> 32:49.440
You may leave now.

32:50.400 --> 32:52.480
Let me be alone for a while.

32:53.110 --> 32:53.910
Your Majesty,

32:54.640 --> 32:55.600
Her Majesty...

32:54.960 --> 32:58.070
[Changchun Palace]

32:55.720 --> 32:57.200
still wishes to see you.

32:57.550 --> 32:58.550
Ignore her.

33:00.480 --> 33:02.270
I need some peace.

33:03.440 --> 33:04.070
Yes.

33:42.440 --> 33:43.370
Feng Pingcheng,

33:44.790 --> 33:45.960
listen.

33:48.400 --> 33:50.000
I will never let Suige

33:50.200 --> 33:51.600
follow in your footsteps

33:52.110 --> 33:54.000
and be trapped by power like you.

33:55.440 --> 33:56.700
My child's future path

33:57.790 --> 34:00.070
will be determined by himself alone.

34:17.110 --> 34:18.280
All these years, the reason

34:18.280 --> 34:19.760
I went all out to save you

34:20.800 --> 34:22.330
was that Qingyu asked me to.

34:23.190 --> 34:24.280
You've been trying so hard

34:24.280 --> 34:25.280
to defeat Qingyu,

34:26.960 --> 34:27.800
yet she was the one

34:27.800 --> 34:29.460
who actually saved your life.

34:32.230 --> 34:33.440
I thought

34:34.800 --> 34:36.659
I would undoubtedly win over you,

34:38.510 --> 34:40.760
yet in the end, I still lost.

34:41.880 --> 34:42.550
Oh, right,

34:43.400 --> 34:44.960
you don't like it when I use

34:45.920 --> 34:47.780
the royal term to refer to myself.

34:48.190 --> 34:48.840
Fine.

34:49.840 --> 34:50.510
As you wish.

34:51.150 --> 34:51.810
As you wish.

34:53.840 --> 34:56.480
Our bond as husband and wife is long gone.

34:57.190 --> 34:59.760
Why did you have Ling Feng save me?

35:01.070 --> 35:03.550
Why did you send him to save me?

35:10.320 --> 35:12.070
You always said I've changed,

35:14.000 --> 35:16.230
that after becoming emperor

35:17.440 --> 35:19.440
I was blinded by power.

35:23.960 --> 35:27.280
But it was you who never saw clearly.

35:28.590 --> 35:30.920
It was you who deceived yourself

35:31.030 --> 35:32.360
with wishful thinking.

35:33.230 --> 35:36.110
I have always been who I am.

35:37.480 --> 35:40.150
My father starved to death.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.190
After he died,

35:44.880 --> 35:48.070
my mother and I
wandered from place to place.

35:50.150 --> 35:51.610
I grew up in a refugee camp,

35:52.190 --> 35:55.190
fighting with others for scraps of food
from the dead.

35:55.360 --> 35:58.070
If we hadn't fought for food,

35:59.190 --> 36:02.150
my mother would've starved to death too.

36:03.710 --> 36:04.800
At that time,

36:05.630 --> 36:07.400
I learned one thing:

36:09.230 --> 36:10.550
If you don't fight

36:11.440 --> 36:12.880
and seize,

36:13.880 --> 36:17.630
you die.

36:19.000 --> 36:19.800
Wei Qingyu.

36:21.400 --> 36:22.440
Wei Qingyu.

36:23.920 --> 36:27.400
I'm leaving the world
I fought for with my life

36:28.510 --> 36:30.510
to our son.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.750
Am I wrong?

36:34.000 --> 36:35.630
Am I wrong?

36:38.480 --> 36:40.070
Am I wrong?

36:40.230 --> 36:41.710
Am I wrong?

37:15.360 --> 37:16.280
You're awake?

37:18.070 --> 37:18.840
I haven't slept this peacefully

37:18.840 --> 37:19.840
in a long time.

37:21.190 --> 37:22.590
You were talking nonstop

37:22.880 --> 37:24.150
in your sleep.

37:24.960 --> 37:25.960
What did I say?

37:30.070 --> 37:31.000
I won't tell you.

37:31.510 --> 37:33.000
I've remembered
all the good things you said

37:33.000 --> 37:33.800
and forgotten

37:34.030 --> 37:35.400
the bad ones for you.

37:36.190 --> 37:37.110
I hope I didn't

37:37.630 --> 37:38.630
say anything bad

37:38.670 --> 37:39.930
about you in my dreams.

37:40.230 --> 37:42.090
Then I definitely can't tell you.

37:42.360 --> 37:43.710
I hold grudges easily—

37:44.230 --> 37:45.630
especially against you.

37:45.710 --> 37:47.570
You only hold grudges against me?

37:47.800 --> 37:48.480
Of course.

37:49.110 --> 37:49.960
I've long forgotten

37:49.960 --> 37:51.360
everyone else's,

37:51.880 --> 37:53.030
but the ones about you—

37:53.030 --> 37:54.360
I'll never forget.

37:56.760 --> 37:57.550
You too.

37:59.070 --> 38:00.070
What do you mean?

38:00.710 --> 38:02.770
You can only hold grudges against me.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.290
Don't ever keep the hurt

38:05.030 --> 38:06.830
others caused you in your heart,

38:07.630 --> 38:09.760
and don't ever use it to hurt yourself.

38:42.070 --> 38:43.270
Why are you laughing?

38:45.000 --> 38:46.730
I just thought of an old saying:

38:47.070 --> 38:49.630
comb your hair once,
and all your worries fade;

38:49.630 --> 38:52.890
comb it twice, and you'll be free
from sickness and sorrow;

38:58.590 --> 39:01.110
comb it three times,
and we will live in harmony;

39:01.110 --> 39:03.910
comb it four times,
and we'll be together forever.

39:04.840 --> 39:05.800
It's obvious

39:05.800 --> 39:07.730
you made up the last ones yourself.

39:07.880 --> 39:10.480
Who would want
to be together with you forever?

39:13.590 --> 39:15.190
Once I've avenged my mother,

39:16.800 --> 39:18.070
we'll live in harmony

39:18.960 --> 39:20.890
and be together forever. Alright?

39:21.320 --> 39:21.960
Alright.

39:28.110 --> 39:28.880
Miss Yixiao.

39:29.760 --> 39:31.620
Miss Yixiao, are you in your room?

39:31.710 --> 39:32.230
I just went to His Highness's chamber

39:32.230 --> 39:33.150
to look for him,

39:33.150 --> 39:33.760
but he wasn't there.

39:33.760 --> 39:34.630
Do you know where he went?

39:34.630 --> 39:36.030
I have something urgent.

39:36.840 --> 39:37.440
Well...

39:41.880 --> 39:43.190
Why are you looking for me?

39:43.190 --> 39:44.670
Nothing.

39:47.230 --> 39:48.090
Your Highness,

39:48.480 --> 39:49.710
I do have

39:49.760 --> 39:51.420
some small matters to report.

39:51.800 --> 39:52.880
The elite soldiers of the Feng Battalion

39:52.880 --> 39:53.480
have assembled

39:53.480 --> 39:54.440
at the city gates,

39:54.440 --> 39:54.960
and the Hound

39:54.960 --> 39:55.880
has come back with the brothers

39:55.880 --> 39:57.230
in the Qiongqi Unit.

39:57.510 --> 39:58.110
Got it.

39:58.760 --> 40:00.400
Tell the Hound to wait for me
in the study.

40:00.400 --> 40:00.960
Yes.

40:01.840 --> 40:02.590
No rush.

40:09.210 --> 40:12.600
[Linfang Hall]

40:09.590 --> 40:10.650
I didn't expect you

40:11.070 --> 40:12.440
to send word

40:12.710 --> 40:13.670
and ask to see me.

40:14.590 --> 40:15.920
The flowers are blooming beautifully
today.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.440
Your Highness, won't you pick a few?

40:17.440 --> 40:20.170
Your Majesty,
you did that on purpose yesterday?

40:21.070 --> 40:21.840
I was certain

40:22.030 --> 40:23.630
you wouldn't dare tell Xia Jingshi

40:23.630 --> 40:25.490
about our meeting in the Library,

40:25.550 --> 40:26.610
so I lent you a hand.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.840
Did you enjoy

40:29.400 --> 40:30.800
those Susha delicacies?

40:31.590 --> 40:32.800
Your Majesty, I don't deserve

40:32.800 --> 40:33.840
such great favor.

40:34.760 --> 40:35.840
Please don't trouble yourself

40:35.840 --> 40:38.370
with trivial matters like this
in the future.

40:45.000 --> 40:46.060
How could anything

40:46.800 --> 40:48.800
concerning you be a trivial matter?

40:52.000 --> 40:53.400
No matter how big or small the matter,

40:53.400 --> 40:54.230
it's between His Highness

40:54.230 --> 40:55.000
and me—

40:55.670 --> 40:57.270
it has nothing to do with you.

41:01.840 --> 41:02.480
What?

41:03.550 --> 41:04.350
Are you angry?

41:05.880 --> 41:07.360
Are you angry that I ruined things

41:07.360 --> 41:08.960
between you and Xia Jingshi?

41:10.920 --> 41:13.250
He shows no appreciation for your beauty,

41:13.590 --> 41:15.590
yet you still care so deeply for him.

41:16.590 --> 41:18.650
I've said everything I needed to say.

41:20.000 --> 41:21.260
I'll take my leave now.

41:24.800 --> 41:25.960
What's so great about Xia Jingshi

41:25.960 --> 41:27.000
that all of you treat him

41:27.000 --> 41:28.330
like the moon in the sky?

41:30.320 --> 41:31.190
Let go of me!

41:34.000 --> 41:35.490
All you Xias are sick!

41:35.590 --> 41:36.230
One's heartless,

41:36.230 --> 41:37.560
and the other's insane!

41:40.590 --> 41:41.280
Heartless?

41:42.500 --> 41:43.070
So you've finally seen

41:43.070 --> 41:44.600
Xia Jingshi's true nature.

42:31.150 --> 42:31.840
My Lord,

42:32.630 --> 42:34.150
your legs are weak.

42:34.670 --> 42:36.630
Why did you put yourself through this?

42:36.630 --> 42:37.830
Is His Majesty

42:37.920 --> 42:39.190
in Changchun Palace?

42:39.800 --> 42:40.440
Yes.

43:16.320 --> 43:18.050
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

43:18.400 --> 43:19.200
Your Majesty.

43:22.070 --> 43:22.710
Get lost!

43:29.440 --> 43:30.240
Your Majesty,

43:30.710 --> 43:32.370
Elder Marquis Murong is here.

43:33.760 --> 43:34.670
I won't see him.

43:35.030 --> 43:37.150
He's carrying thorny branches on his back—

